id":3461586125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OU5zN","user":{"login":"naturally-intelligent","id":6783606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODM2MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6783606?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent","html_url":"https://github.com/naturally-intelligent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T13:40:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T13:41:35Z","body":"I'm still getting this error in 4.5.1 stable\n\nI probably get it every 2 days or so. Just from undoing typical stuff like node properties (position, modulate, etc). Have to restart Godot, changes get lost (but usually the work lost isnt substantial)\n\nThis unfortunately isn't fixed.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3461586125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3464771283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110288#issuecomment-3464771283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110288","id":3464771283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OhDbT","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T23:01:45Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T23:02:02Z","body":"It's difficult to do anything else without more details. I never had this error and I use 4.5.1 daily.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3464771283/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507447742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110288#issuecomment-3507447742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110288","id":3507447742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RD2e-","user":{"login":"QuaaDev","id":120607419,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzBSuw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120607419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev","html_url":"https://github.com/QuaaDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuaaDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T03:04:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T03:14:49Z","body":"I encountered the same error today. My game doesn't have any audio system, I was editing control nodes when it happened.\n\nBefore it happened, I had been pressing Ctrl+Z a lot because I was testing things. Out of nowhere, this error started appearing, and it also messed up the values ​​of some control nodes. The \"Inconsistent redo history\" error caused the error \"condition parent_rect_size.x == 0.0 is true\" (This error appeared when I moved control nodes in the scene).\n\nThe solution was as follows: First, I fixed the \"condition parent blabla\" error by changing the value of that variable. Then, I restarted Godot to see if the \"Inconsistent redo history\" error would be fixed. It was, but the \"condition parent blabla\" error reappeared. I don't know if the changes weren't saved or if the error altered the variable again. I'll include screenshots of the output I got.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16464e85-77cf-4aab-b6b3-17a2ecb602d1)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f87bb48d-3dc6-4fae-8d8a-0d53e58c5a6e)\n\nedit: I forgot to mention that the \"Inconsistent redo history\" error appeared every time I changed any parameter of the control nodes. Any action resulted in that error. Because of how my scene is made, all the nodes had been altered by ctrl + z, my instinct tells me that the error comes from there: Undoing many changes repeatedly. And I use the stable version 4.5 from Steam.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507447742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507529550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110288#issuecomment-3507529550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110288","id":3507529550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7REKdO","user":{"login":"Zephilinox","id":2060863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjA4NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2060863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox","html_url":"https://github.com/Zephilinox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zephilinox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T04:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T04:58:21Z","body":"fwiw I see this issue quite a lot too, on 4.5.1. usually some mixture of undo, redo, and changing something (atm shader parameters) 